export anchor FunnelFirstStyle:
    number: 338
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Funnel first
    idea: A large stepped funnel in pale sea greens leads the screen, each band naming its stage, count and value, with a round target gauge beside it and the deals laid out in soft rounded stage trays underneath.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deep: #0b1514, the page and the style sheet
        surface: #12201f, the funnel panel, cards and activity
        tray: #172927, stage trays, mini figures and secondary buttons
        line: #26403d, the gauge track and field borders
        ink: #e6f2ef, text
        muted: #9db8b2, labels and owners
        foam: #a7f0de, the Lead band
        sea: #86e3d0, the Qualified band, primary button and icons
        lagoon: #66d2be, the Proposal band
        teal: #47bba8, the Negotiation band
        sand: #f6d58a, the Won spout, target gauge, Closed pill and focus
        darkText: #06201b, text on every band and on the primary button
        coral: #ffb08a, the Stalled pill, dashed, with a triangle
    type:
        A rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round,
        Segoe UI, system-ui. Base 15px. Headings 26px at 800, the gauge
        figure 28px at 800, band labels 17px at 800 with values 20px at
        800, card values 20px at 800, labels 12px at 600.
    layout:
        A small header with a rounded B tile, Brightwork Sales over Deal
        pipeline, a Q4 pill and an Add deal pill. A wide rounded panel holds
        Pipeline funnel Q4. On the left five centred bands narrow from full
        width to 44 percent, each a trapezoid with slanted sides, pale
        green to teal, the last a sand spout with rounded bottom corners
        for Won. Each band reads stage, deal count and listed value in dark
        text, and a caption says width shows stage order. On the right a
        ring gauge shows 64 percent beside Won this quarter 128,500 of
        200,000 target, over three small rounded tiles for pipeline value,
        win rate and open deals. Deals by stage follows as five rounded
        trays with a coloured dot matching the band, holding cards with
        name, a large value, owner and a status pill. Latest holds the
        activity. Below 1050px the gauge sits under the funnel and trays go
        two across, on phones one across and bands wrap their text.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px panel padding, 14px between trays, 10px between cards, 6px between bands.
    density: Low at the top where the funnel fills the width, medium in the trays below.
    corners: Very round. 28px hero, 22px trays, 16px cards, pill buttons and status pills.
    borders: Almost none. Surfaces step in tone, and a dashed coral outline marks stalled.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 2 stroke. Each pill pairs its word with a
        calendar, paper plane, flag, check or triangle.
    focus: A 3px sand outline offset 3px.
    tone: Friendly and short, such as Pipeline funnel, Deals by stage, Latest and Add deal.
